---
// 연구 (/[lang]/research). Scope / Themes / Projects 세 섹션. 헤더 하위 메뉴가 앵커로 연결된다.
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/base-layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/page-header.astro";
import Section from "../../components/section.astro";
import {
  researchScope,
  researchAreas,
  researchProjects,
  localizedText,
} from "../../lib/content";
import {
  localePaths,
  useTranslations,
  type Locale,
} from "../../i18n/utils";

export const getStaticPaths = localePaths;

const lang = Astro.params.lang as Locale;
const t = useTranslations(lang);

const scope = localizedText(researchScope, "scope", lang);

const areas = researchAreas
  .map((a) => {
    // 키워드도 텍스트와 같은 폴백: 현재 언어 목록이 비면 다른 언어 목록을 쓴다.
    const primary = lang === "ko" ? a.themes_ko : a.themes;
    const fallback = lang === "ko" ? a.themes : a.themes_ko;
    return {
      id: a.id,
      title: localizedText(a, "title", lang),
      summary: localizedText(a, "summary", lang),
      themes: primary.length ? primary : fallback,
    };
  })
  .filter((a) => a.title);

const projects = researchProjects
  .map((p) => ({
    id: p.id,
    title: localizedText(p, "title", lang),
    period: p.period,
    funder: localizedText(p, "funder", lang),
  }))
  .filter((p) => p.title);
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={t("nav.research")} description={scope ?? undefined}>
  <PageHeader title={t("nav.research")} lede={t("research.lede")} />

  {
    scope && (
      <Section id="scope" title={t("nav.research.scope")}>
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">{scope}</p>
      </Section>
    )
  }

  <Section id="themes" title={t("nav.research.themes")} muted>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        areas.map((a) => (
          <article class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">{a.title}</h3>
            {a.summary && (
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">{a.summary}</p>
            )}
            {a.themes.length > 0 && (
              <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {a.themes.map((th) => (
                  <li class="rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                    {th}
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            )}
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section id="projects" title={t("nav.research.projects")}>
    <ul class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
      {
        projects.map((p) => (
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">
            <span class="font-medium text-ink">{p.title}</span>
            <span class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">
              {p.funder ? `${t("research.projectFunder")}: ${p.funder} · ` : ""}
              {p.period}
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
